@lang pt
IMPORT prelude

GIVEN a IS A NUMBER
      b IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@nlg:en MIXFIX-HERALD the first is larger
a `supera` b MEANS a GREATER THAN b

GIVEN a IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
@nlg:en PREFIX-HERALD positive
`positivo` a MEANS a GREATER THAN 0

#ASSERT 3 `supera` 2
#ASSERT `positivo` 3
